inium which is known to be highly fashionable is also a major part of its appeal. This property was developed applying excellent architecture skills. At the launch of this property, all the units were sold out. This success was attributed to features such as the clubhouse which covers an area of about 6,600 square feet. Other features of Sterling such as the availability of Internet broadband in the common area is also notable and tailored towards outmost luxury and comfort. The in-house facilities within Sterling Condominium include highly impressive ones. These facilities include the 6,600 square feet clubhouse for which the property is particular known. Round-the-clock security services is also available to residents of this property. Residents of Sterling Condominium also have access to facilities such as a badminton court, a barbecue area, broadband community network, a cafeteria, a covered car park, a gymnasium, a jacuzzi, a multipurpose hall, a playground, a swimming pool and a tennis court.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nKediaman Servis untuk Disewa di South View oleh Vincent Beh (https://www.iproperty.com.my/bm/properti/kampung-kerinchi-bangsar-south/south-view/rent-102043331/)\nciteturn132search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: last week; Crawled: 6 days ago; # South View, Kampung Kerinchi (Bangsar South) ... ### Serviced residence for Rent ... * For Sale- 648-651sf 1+1 Bedrooms: RM580k\n\n# South View, Kampung Kerinchi (Bangsar South)\n\nJalan Kerinchi Kiri 2, Kampung Kerinchi (Bangsar South), Kuala Lumpur\n\n## RM 2,800 /bulan\n\n* * *\n\n2\n\nBT\n\n2\n\nBM\n\n823\n\nkps\n\n* * *\n\n2\n\n450 m ({5 mins) from Universiti\n\nImage: loading-bay-o\n\nSedia untuk Dimasuki Kediaman Servis\n\n* * *\n\nImage: photo\n\nGambar\n\nPaparan Peta\n\n## Butiran hartanah\n\nImage: check-small-fKediaman Servis untuk disewa  | Image: check-small-fKelengkapan penuh\nImage: check-small-fDisiapkan pada 2017  | Image: check-sm